window.products.push({"id":236167,"name":"SMERRAG Soap Dispenser Dish, Stainless Steel Case Glass Liner Hand Pump Dispenser with Free Funnel and Stickers, Refillable Liquid Hand Soap Lotion Di","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GCgKroc2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎁 THOUGHTFUL GIFT: This Soap Dispenser comes with a collapsible funnel and label stickers. The funnel is easy to store and clean, and the stickers allow you to personalize the dispenser. 💙 RUST&LEAK PROOF DESIGN: Constructed with 304 brushed nickel stainless steel, this dish soap dispenser is built to last. The inner layer is made of 100% lead-free, thick glass, ensuring that the contents remain safe and secure. The anti-rust coating prevents corrosion and damage, making it a durable and long-lasting addition to your kitchen or bathroom. 💙 LONG-LASTING & DURABLE: Our dish soap dispenser is made of 304 brushed nickel stainless steel and features a thick glass inner layer. The pump has undergone 50,000 running tests to ensure its longevity and durability. With a 12-month warranty, you can trust in the quality of our product. Contact us if you have any questions. 💙 ELEGANT DESIGN: This soap dispenser features a brushed stainless steel casing and clear glass liner bottle, allowing you to easily monitor the liquid levels. With a large capacity of 11oz/320ml, you will have to refill less frequently. The sleek and translucent design makes it a perfect addition to any home. 💙 EASY TO USE & LABEL: One-handed dispensing with a precise pump ensures easy and convenient use, without worrying about leakage or drips. With the included 6 waterproof stickers, you can label and distinguish different liquid dispensers for a practical and organized solution. 💙 MULTI-FUNCTIONAL: This sleek stainless steel soap dispenser can be filled with a variety of liquids including liquid soap, dish soap, lotion, shampoo, body wash, mouthwash, hand sanitizer, massage oils, and more. It makes a great gift for friends, family, or new neighbors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GCgKroc2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SMERRAG","source_asin":"B09GK4CTGM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-236167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GK4CTGM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GK4CTGM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
