window.products.push({"id":236222,"name":"ARIGHTEX Gold Octopus Bedding, Nautical Sea Octopus in Blue, 3 Piece Sea Creature Duvet Cover, Cool and Retro Bedspread for Kids Teens Adults (Full)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.58,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oIkNIUrPL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"To help your comforter stay cleaner and last longer, invest in a decorative bedding duvet cover. Duvets covers are machine washable and are made with easy-to-close hidden zippers, making it easy to take on and off. PRODUCT SPECIFICATION: - Fabric: 100% lightweight microfiber,material; - Images imprinted using heat dyesublimation technique for lasting effects; - Size: 4 sizes; - CARE: no extra care, machine washable andtumble dryer safe.  AVAILABLE SIZES: Twin: 1*Duvet cover: 69 by 86 inches 2*Pillow Shams: 20 by 26 inches Full: 1*Duvet cover: 81 by 90 inches 2*Pillow Shams: 20 by 26 inches Queen: 1*Duvet cover: 90 by 90 inches 2*Pillow Shams: 20 by 36 inches King: 1*Duvet cover: 104 by 90 inches 2*Pillow Shams: 20 by 36 inches FINISH: Step 1: Lay the comforter flat on top of your mattress. Step 2: Take your duvet cover and turn it inside out. Insert your hands inside and find the two top corners. You should now be holding one corner in each hand. Step 3: With your hands inside the duvet cover, reach down to grab hold of the comforter’s top two corners Step 4: Holding the top two corner slightly, flip the duvet cover right side out over the comforter. Give it a shake and a fluff until the duvet cover falls down to cover most of the comforter. Step 5: Pull the duvet cover down. Stuff the bottom two corners of the comforter inside the bottom two corners of the duvet cover. Once everything is aligned, zip it up!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oIkNIUrPL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARIGHTEX","source_asin":"B08D3HS2S1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-236222","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D3HS2S1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D3HS2S1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":236223,"name":"Volans Bar Stools Set of 2, Mid Century Modern Counter Stools Faux Leather Swivel Adjustable Height, Barstools Bar Height Set of 2 Chair with Back, Bl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Dqmif3PpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Modern Elegance】Embrace a modern twist on a kitchen classic with the Volans Barstool. Featuring a sleek black powder-coated steel base, it is adorned with soft vegan leather upholstery and stylish channel stitching, seamlessly blending into any cafe, bar, pub, or home dining area. 【Adjustable Heights】Customize the barstool to fit your needs with its adjustable height feature. From counter height to bar height, effortlessly adapt it to kitchen island counters, breakfast bars, home bars, standing desks, restaurant tables, lounges, and more using the convenient handle below the seat. 【Smooth Swivel】Experience 360-degree rotation with ease. The swivel bar stools with back allow for smooth and quiet movement, enabling you to stay engaged in conversations while savoring your favorite drink or meal. 【Style and Comfort Combined】Indulge in style and comfort as you sit on the wide seat and gently sloped backrest. The ergonomic design contours to your body and offers added cushioning with foam filling, perfect for enjoying quick weeknight meals. The integrated footrest adds a contemporary touch while supporting your feet. 【Sturdy and Stable】Enjoy superior stability and support with the grounded base of the Volans bar stools. The base boasts a generous diameter of 16.14 inches, ensuring sturdiness. It is thoughtfully designed with anti-slip floor protectors, preventing scratches and ensuring your floors remain intact. 【Easy Assembly】Experience hassle-free assembly with included instructions and tools. The chair dimensions are 19.5\" W x 19.7\" D x 33.5\" – 41.5\" H, while the seat height ranges from 23.4\" to 31.5\". With a weight capacity of 286 lbs, it combines practicality and durability in one stylish package.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Dqmif3PpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Volans","source_asin":"B0831DN8YJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-236223","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0831DN8YJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0831DN8YJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
