window.products.push({"id":236294,"name":"JINGCHENG Buffalo Plaid Throw Blanket Soft Flannel Fleece Checker Pattern Warm Decorative Blanket for Bed Couch 350GSM (Grey/White, Twin(60\"x80\"))","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71id8qyZlAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Warm & Soft: Utilize high-grade 350GSM flannel fleece fabric to create extra warmth and softness on both sides. Fluffy, anti-pilling, durable, wrinkle, and fade resistant. Classic Design: Classic checker plaid pattern endows a chic and trendy feeling. Easily coordinated and can be regarded as a wonderful decoration. Wide Versatility: Available in 5 sizes: Throw (40\"x50\"), Throw (50\"x60\"), Twin (60\"x80\"), Queen (90\"x90\") and King (90\"x108\") to satisfy multiple needs. Keep cozy and warm while protecting your luxury bed and couch from dirt and stain. Optimal Gift: Perfect for gifts on friend's birthday, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Christmas, Thanksgiving Day, etc. Easy to Care: Machine washable with cold water, gentle cycle, tumble dry low, low iron.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71id8qyZlAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JINGCHENG","source_asin":"B08317X9GF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-236294","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08317X9GF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08317X9GF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
