window.products.push({"id":236296,"name":"Threadmill Luxury Cotton Blankets for King Size Bed | All-Season Cozy 100% Cotton King Size Blanket | Herringbone Soft & Lightweight Fall Thermal Blan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Phuaun5SS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM SOFTNESS & TEXTURE WITH PURE COTTON HERRINGBONE BLANKET: If you love snuggling in the warmth of a cozy fall blanket, our soft heated throw blanket is the perfect choice for you. 100% natural long staple yarns are woven together forming a herringbone design to give you the ideal combination of smoothness and comfort in one. COZY SNUGGLES IN OUR PERFECT WEIGHT KING SIZE BLANKET: Designed to have the ideal weight, our breathable cotton throw blankets give you the warmth and comfort you deserve. With a generous size of 106 x 92 inches , our warm thermal bed blanket can be used by both adults and children alike. Its smooth feel and plush weight make it the ideal choice to wrap yourself up when relaxing, lounging, or reading. VERSATILE THROW BLANKET FOR ALL SEASONS & PURPOSES: Car, couch, or bedroom, this stylish and perfect weight throw can be used anywhere anytime. Its herringbone design gives it a decorative and modern look that accentuates your entire home decor. Whether it is a cheerful summer outdoor trip or a lazy winter indoor night, this all-season blanket is ideal for every weather. Its breathability and moisture-wicking properties let you stay cool and comfortable on warm days. EASY TO CARE AND DURABLE CONSTRUCTION: The superior craftsmanship and intricate weave make our throw blanket extremely sturdy and durable. To enjoy its superior softness and prevent shrinkage, the blanket must be machine washed and tumble dried on low. It gets softer and smoother after each wash while maintaining its sturdiness and fade-resistance. These features ensure that the blanket retains its quality and vibrant color even after several wash cycles. PERFECT GIFT CHOICE WITH 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Spoil your near and dear ones by gifting them a cozy experience of sleeping in a cloud with our soft thermal blanket. Enjoy this delightful experience without any worry. Along with brilliant quality, our products also come with a 100% satisfaction guarantee. If you face any issue, write back to us and we will fix it. All our products are made in OEKO-TEX Standard 100 factory which meets the highest safety and environmental standards.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Phuaun5SS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Threadmill","source_asin":"B07JL8T1PZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-236296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JL8T1PZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JL8T1PZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
