window.products.push({"id":236397,"name":"Insulated Lunch Bag for Women Men, Reusable Lunch Box , Leakproof Water Resistant Cooler Tote Lunch Bag with Detachable and Adjustable Shoulder Strap ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FLdnp0CYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍎【 Insulation and Freezing】: The inner lining of the lunch box is composed of environmentally friendly EVA and 5mm thick thermal insulation pearl foam, and the outer layer is made of durable 300D Oxford cloth fabric, so that the ladies lunch bag has a four-layer insulation function to keep the food cold/warm/fresh Within hours, you can enjoy the most delicious food anytime, anywhere. 🍎【Large Capacity】: The size of the insulated lunch bag is 30*17*25cm (L*W*H), and the spacious space can store all your food. There are 1 compartments on the front and back of the adult lunch bag, and there are small side pockets on the left and right sides. You can store your mobile phone, tablet, card, water bottle and other items, making your travel easier and more worry-free. 🍎【Leakproof and Waterproof】: The Lunch Bag Organizer is carefully sewn with EVA liner and high-quality composite waterproof fabric. The outside is equipped with high-quality SBS double zippers, which can not only prevent rain from splashing, but also don't worry about sauce leakage. The EVA environmentally friendly material of the inner liner of the outdoor lunch bag is easy to clean. Even if the sauce is spilled, just wipe it with a wet paper towel to make your life more convenient. 🍎【Convenient to Carry】: Sfuzwg lunch bag is equipped with a reinforced handle, and is equipped with a detachable and adjustable soft shoulder strap, the shoulder strap can be adjusted from 10 inches to 32 inches, not only can be used as a stylish handbag, a comfortable shoulder bag , It can also be used to make a diagonal bag for poor travel, providing you with a variety of options for travel. 🍎【Use in Many Occasions】: The lunch tote bag is fashionable in shape and is loved by men and women. It can be used as a lunch bag, insulation bag, picnic bag, sundries bag or shopping bag. Whether you are using it for an office, school, gym, outdoor picnic, business trip or long-distance trip, this insulated lunch bag is a good choice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FLdnp0CYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sfuzwg","source_asin":"B09HTV9KWJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-236397","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HTV9KWJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HTV9KWJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
