window.products.push({"id":236422,"name":"Ultra Soft Nurse Theme Blanket Microfiber Plush Sherpa Blanket Gifts for Women Nurses Warm Cozy Fuzzy Throw Blanket for Bed and Couch (Nurse Blanket04","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ni8MpNIwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nurse Theme Super Soft Cozy Sherpa Throw Blanket! Warm You and Your Family and Friends! ! !   Description:  Feature :Anti-Pilling，Durable Pattern : Nurse Theme Material Type : Microfiber Plush Grade : High Quality Advantages : Comfortable,Soft   Sizes:  This throw blanket comes in two sizes 130cm ×150cm (51inches × 59 inches) ； 150cm ×200cm (59 inches × 79inches) . 1. Please purchase the correct size as needed. Large enough to wrap you up. 2. It is fuzzy and thick, also very friendly to people with sensitive skin.   Occasions:  Can be Used in Air Conditioning Room, Bedroom as Warm Blanket, Cozy up in the Couch Enjoy Favorite Movie in Winter Nights, Airplane Travel Blanket ?Outdoor Picnic Hunting Camping Beach Blankets etc. Decorative and Functional.   Q&A:  1. Can this throw blanket be washed in a washing machine? Yes! It can be washed in a washing machine, but care must be taken not to wash it with water above 60°C. 2. Is this nurse blanket free returnable? Yes! It's free returnable. Also if you have any question about this blanket please contact us and we will answer all the questions you may have.  3. How is it packaged? The blankets were vacuum packaged for better shipment. 4. Will it fade after washing? No! It's digital printing. Won't fade after long term use. 5. Is its color as vivid as picture? The color of the actual product will not be as sharp as the picture, because the actual product is to enlarge the picture many times, the color will not be so smooth and delicate. But we do our best to keep its color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ni8MpNIwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GHMOHAME","source_asin":"B0BN86D3DB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-236422","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN86D3DB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN86D3DB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
