window.products.push({"id":236434,"name":"Famedio Adjustable Cervical Pillow for Neck Pain Relief, Hollow Contour Memory Foam Pillows Plus Support, Odorless Orthopedic Bed Pillows for Sleeping","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XFuc3aZHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"U.S PATENT HOLLOW DESIGN, LET GO OF YOUR NECK PAIN! The sink-in center which adapts to your head contour, not only encases the head but also holds your head in place, ensuring your head and neck are aligned with the natural curve of the spine. Releasing the pressure of your neck by increasing blood flow, this neck pillow also helps open up your air passages to smooth breathing. You can sink comfortably into this bed pillow, enjoy a painless, uninterrupted sleep and wake up feeling refreshed! AN ERGONOMIC WONDER, CONTOUR TO YOUR BODY PERFECTLY! Created together by ergonomic designers and chiropractors, Famedio contour pillow is far from a one-trick pony. The Arc neck area gently fits the neck and provides adequate support. Fuller areas on two sides are high enough to accommodate shoulders and provide needed support while sleeping on the side. The special wing area gives arms a rest spot. Whether for side back or stomach sleepers, this sleeping pillow will make a world of difference! WIDER LOFT RANGE, EASILY ADJUST TO A THICKNESS YOU LOVE! You’re probably tired of trying countless pillows to decide what thickness you love most. Now you've found the solution! Famedio adjustable cervical pillow allows you to change the loft and feel, all in one pillow! It has different lofts on each side, the removable insert gives it a wider adjustment range than other neck support pillows. Moreover, you can contact us for an extra insert. No need to get a new pillow for changing loft needs! UPGRADED QUALITY! BRING YOU SLEEP WITH HEALTH & COMFORT! Engineered with a proprietary version of odorless certified memory foam, Famedio ergonomic pillows also utilize advanced cellular polymer technology. What does all that mean? Not only your pillow for neck pain is safe without any harmful substances but is going to stay supportive for longer use than others! Don't worry about hot sleep, 3D mesh pillowcase is moisture-wicking and breathable, it will make night sweats a thing of the past! WE PROMISE OUR AFTER-SALE SUPPORT, IT'S A NO-RISK TRIAL! If you're looking for a way to get rid of neck pain and sleepless night, give Famedio memory foam pillow a chance! We offer our customers more than just an amazing pillow! A 100-night sleep trial gives you enough time to check whether it is the magic bullet you’ve been looking for! We also offer 5-year support, for any questions, please contact us and we will reply within 24h. Start your pain-free living with this side sleeping pillow!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XFuc3aZHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Famedio","source_asin":"B0C2Z4P7VZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-236434","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2Z4P7VZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2Z4P7VZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
