window.products.push({"id":236448,"name":"66 Pcs Mylar Bags, 5 Gallon Mylar Bags for Food Storage 4 Sizes 10 Mil Thickness Mylar Foil Bag with 6 Pcs 1000cc 60 Pcs 500cc Oxygen Absorbers 80 Pcs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+zaeWMamL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CONTENTS& SIZE: 6 Pcs x5 Gallon (17x26\")+15 Pcs 1 Gallon (10x14\")+25 Pcs 1 Quart (6x9\")+ 20 Pcs 1/3 Pint (4x6\")+60 Pcs oxygen absorber(500 cc) + 6 Pcs oxygen absorber(1000 cc)+80 Pcs Lables. We offer 4 size mylar bag and 2 larger oxygen absorber which can storage more food and absorb oxygen faster. THICKER THICKNESS: Our mylar bag thickness is 10 mil, and per side is 5 mil. It has an added internal layer of aluminum foil which provides excellent durability and seal resistance. Ensure that you can store your food for a longer period. REUSABLE ZIPPER - Our stand-up mylar bag has a convenient zipper that can be sealed, opened, and re-sealed. Heat-sealed above the zipper for long-term storage by using the household iron, hair straightener, sealer bag tools, etc. FOOD-GRADE MATERIAL: Our mylar bags are made from food-grade material not including BPA with three layers: PET, aluminum foil, and PE. Multifunction positions to dehydrate food for storage, including grains, beans, oats, dried fruit, candies, coffee beans, tea, etc. WARM REMINDER: Our oxygen absorber is 500 cc and 1000 cc which can help you absorb the oxygen. Noticeably, the oxygen absorbers do NOT absorb air; they absorb oxygen which is only 21% of the air. About 1/5 of the air volume will be gone, 4/5 remains no matter how many absorbers are used.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+zaeWMamL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BIOBUBANA","source_asin":"B0B1TXH874","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-236448","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1TXH874","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1TXH874","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
