window.products.push({"id":236450,"name":"Food Storage Containers with Lids, Lockcoo 10 Pack Airtight Round Plastic Storage Containers Sets for Food, Stackable BPA Free Kitchen Storage Contain","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r70wkCedS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BPA-free Thicken Plastic 🥝【20 Piece Food Storage Containers Set】- Your Complete Bundle comes with 10 premium air tight food storage containers with 10 lids with various sizes, contemporary styling & shape, versatile to meet your everyday food storage needs. Just prepare food ahead of time or store leftovers in our containers, then pop them in the freezer or microwave to enjoy a home-cooked meal anywhere – at home, work, school, or the gym. Fast & easy! Clear body for easy identification of contents from any angle. 🥪【5 Size Combinations Fit Your Needs】- Our food storage containers comes in 5 different sizes. Includes 2*2200ML(75OZ), 2*1200ML(41OZ), 2*650ML(22OZ), 2*260mL(9OZ), 2*70mL(2.5OZ) ; From meat, deli food, noodles, green salads, colorful pasta, slime and veggie soups to cupcakes, chocolate desserts, bread, snacks and fruit, these meal prep containers are the way to go. Store food for later or prepare lunch ahead of time! 🍤【100% Spill-proof & Improve Locking Lids】Never worry about spilled food in your lunch bag ever again. The snap-on lids provide an airtight, 100% leakproof seal to preserve freshness and prevent food from leaking and spilling. Improved BPA free locking lid design is easier to open and shut. The silicone lining creates a seal that keeps air out and keeps food and liquid in. Safe for microwave, dishwasher and freezer; please note that open the airtight lid before heating in microwave. 🍤【CBPA Free Upgraded Thicken Material】- Microwave Safe! Freezer Safe! Dishwasher Safe! Our food storage containers with lids are made of high quality thicken PP material, eco-friendly and BPA free which can keep your food fresh for a long period. They are non toxic, durable, resilient and ready to withstand everyday wear and tear, won’t absorb food odors, flavors, or stains. Improved lids adopt to high impact resistant ABS which means you don’t need to worry about the Lids breaking. 🍒【Pile Them Up for Easy Space Saving】- BPA free containers for food adopts to lid indentations design allowing stackable and nesting, which make efficient use of every inch of your home kitchen. Take up less space and easily fit into & stay organized in the fridge or cabinet which enables you to get the kitchen well-look and frees up space in the pantry. Easy to use and clean. Great for both liquid and solid food. Enjoy your favorite food on the go!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r70wkCedS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lockcoo","source_asin":"B08XZJDBWF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-236450","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XZJDBWF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XZJDBWF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":236451,"name":"The Bradford Exchange Wall Decor: Thomas Kinkade Sunday Evening Sleigh Ride Wall Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VJgzVSlYL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"World-renowned Painter of Light Thomas Kinkade has always captivated admirers with the living light that glows from within his inviting paintings. His acclaimed Sunday Evening Sleigh Ride is perhaps one of his most shining examples of how his images beckon you to come inside, warm up and give thanks for your blessings. Now, this beloved painting is presented as never before with the Thomas Kinkade Sunday Evening Sleigh Ride Wall Decor, a Gallery Editions framed canvas pring exclusive from The Bradford Exchange. This first-of-a-kind limited-edition Thomas Kinkade canvas print lights up with the flip of a switch as 8 concealed LED lights and 75 strategically placed fiber optic lights gently change color! Golden lights illuminate the lamppost, church windows and the winter sky while the lights on the festively decorated pine trees gently change color to add even more realism and warmth to the scene. Plus, a single light shines above the Nativity display beside the church entrance. Hand-applied glitter on the country road and rooftops provides extra sparkle to the snow. Measuring nearly 2 feet wide in its cherry-toned wood frame, this Thomas Kinkade Sunday Evening Sleigh Ride canvas print faithfully recreates the look and feel of the artist's original painting. A brass title plaque adds the perfect finishing touch to this Gallery Editions masterpiece. Hand-applied glitter on the country road and rooftops provides extra sparkle to the snow This genuine Thomas Kinkade canvas print is beautifully showcased in a rich cherry-toned wood Gallery Editions frame with a brass title plate Hanging device included for immediate, secure display Requires 3 \"AA\" batteries (not included) Edition limited to 120 crafting days, so order now! Hand-numbered with a matching Certificate of Authenticity Measures 20\" W x 12\" H; 50.8 cm W x 30.5 cm H","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VJgzVSlYL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Bradford Exchange","source_asin":"B00ENOANK6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-236451","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ENOANK6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ENOANK6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
