window.products.push({"id":236552,"name":"WAMPAT TV Stand for TVs up to 75 Inch, Wood Entertainment Center with 6 Storage Cubby, Television Stands Media Console Table for Living Room Bedroom, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+Ul0WQgQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Universal TV Stand】Overall dimension: 70”×15.5”×23.6”(L×W×H). The antique black TV stand is compatible with Samsung, Sony, LG, Sharp, Insignia, Vizio, Haier, Toshiba, Sharp, Element, TCL, Westinghouse 50, 55, 60, 65 inch flat screens. It can be used as a console table, entertainment center and entryway table, meeting your various needs. You could install 18” electric fireplace in the middle shelf. 【6 Cubby for Storage】Designed with 6 storage cubby, the entertainment center provide you with ample storage space to meet daily storage requirements. Three layers of shelves allow you to place magazines, CDs, remote controls and other items to improve space utilization. Plus, the middle open shelf makes you could place more taller items. 【Humanized Detail Design】The media cabinet is equipped with foot pads to avoid scratching the floor. It is worth mentioning that the distance between the bottom plate and the floor is large enough so that your robot vacuum cleaner can pass freely. 【Durable Material & Stable Frame】Made of superior P2 MDF, the television stands are durable and sturdy enough to be used for a long time. In addition, four wooden legs further enhance stability, preventing the 70 inch TV stand from wobbling. Max load capacity: 260 lbs. 【Easy to Assemble & Clean】With detailed instruction and all hardware, the wood TV stand for 75 inch TV is effortless to assemble. And its smooth waterproof surface is easy to clean with a soft damp cloth to facilitate your cleaning work. If you have any quality problems, just contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+Ul0WQgQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WAMPAT","source_asin":"B09NKTSZ7W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-236552","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NKTSZ7W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NKTSZ7W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":236553,"name":"Butter Bell - The Original Butter Bell crock by L Tremain, a Countertop French Ceramic Butter Dish Keeper for Spreadable Butter, Café Retro Collection","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zjUmxwURL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEAUTIFUL GLOSSY COLORS AND CHEF RECOMMENDED – The immensely popular Retro Café collection of Butter Bell crocks features the words “butter” and “beurre” (French for butter) in a delicate raised relief pattern on opposite sides of the base of the crock. Available in a variety of vibrant glazes to match your kitchen or tabletop décor. Conveniently sized for optimal butter freshness, the Butter Bell crock is easy to handle and fits neatly on your countertop. DURABLE HIGH-QUALITY CERAMICS ENSURE LONGEVITY – The Butter Bell crocks are made from a proprietary, high-grade ceramic mixture called New Bone China. This liquid clay mixture is poured into pre-cast plaster molds, then allowed to set for several hours. When dry, the butter containers are carefully removed from their molds, glazed, and fired at 2200 degrees to create a beautiful, scratch resistant finish. The crocks contain NO lead or cadmium and are backed by a 2-year limited warranty. THE ORIGINAL AND THE BEST FOR 25 YEARS – Modeled after the original French beurrier, the Butter Bell crock by L. Tremain keeps butter fresh and spreadable for weeks without refrigeration, spoilage or odors. The two-piece design features an inverted bell-shaped lid and crock base for serving butter at the table, while protecting and storing the butter after each use. EASY TO USE FOR ALL TYPES OF BUTTER – It’s so simple! Pour 1/3 cup of cold water into the base of the crock, then pack the lid FIRMLY with softened butter. Replace the lid into the base and you’re ready to go! An airtight seal protects and preserves butter’s delicate flavor and freshness. Each butter keeper holds one stick or cube (1/2 cup or 125 grams) of your favorite brand of butter, or even your own homemade butter. Try adding fresh herbs or spices to make a delicious, flavored butter! ENVIRONMENTALLY FRIENDLY GIFT PACKAGING – Each Butter Bell crock is securely packaged in a specially designed, environmentally friendly, four-color gift box – the perfect choice for your gift giving holidays, birthdays or special occasions. For over a quarter century, consumers worldwide have been experiencing the pleasures of spreadable butter kept in this unique and time-honored serving dish for butter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zjUmxwURL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Butter Bell","source_asin":"B09VMY9DWX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-236553","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VMY9DWX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VMY9DWX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
