window.products.push({"id":236813,"name":"SUPER-BIO-FUEL Firepot + Tiki Torch + Wick Fuel : 1/2 Case (6 liters)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rbDCd9v8L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"SUPER-BIO-FUEL requires a wicked burner. Most tiki torches are wicked (be sure it is fiberglass and at least 1/2\" in diameter), but fire pots with an open cup are not. Nor are many ventless fireplace burners unless they have been specially fitted with fiberglass batting to burn this type of fuel. Please confirm that you have the correct burner before purchasing. We offer CROSSFIRE FIREPOT CONVERSION WICKS to upgrade your existing fire pot in order to take advantage of this incredible fuel. See our other offerings for details. SUPER-BIO-FUEL is the revolutionary new fuel for fiberglass-wicked devices. It provides a safer alternative and longer burn time than ethanol fuels. It is uniquely NON-FLAMMABLE (flash point 200º F) providing ultra-safe handling. This naturally eliminates flash fires and flare-ups due to it's high flash point. Pouring this fuel onto a burning flame only puts the fire out! SUPER-BIO-FUEL is NON-HAZARDOUS, generating no harmful exhaust or odor. In fact, the only exhaust is CO2 + Water Vapor (in similar amounts to human exhalation). NO soot, NO smoke, NO toxins and NO residue. It's also recycled and sustainable, making it all-around planet-friendly. SUPER-BIO-FUEL is COMBUSTIBLE and burns efficiently in any device that utilizes fiberglass batting or wick that is at least 1/2\" in diameter. It has no special storage requirements. It's rated non-flammable and should not impact facility insurance coverage unlike other more dangerous flammable fuels. SUPER-BIO-FUEL is safe to use and store indoors. It's also uniquely suited for RV and MARINE use. SUPER-BIO-FUEL is NOT a fossil fuel. It's renewable, sustainable and Planet-Friendly....and a great clean-burning alternative to ethanol and canned ethanol gel fuels. SUPER-BIO-FUEL IS FUEL REDEFINED!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rbDCd9v8L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Super Bio Fuel","source_asin":"B008N03AW4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-236813","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008N03AW4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008N03AW4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
