window.products.push({"id":236995,"name":"Meat Thermometer Digital Instant Read Thermometer Ultra-Fast Cooking Food Thermometer with 4.6” Folding Probe Calibration Function for Kitchen Milk Ca","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gkka0mqML._AC_SL1218_.jpg","description":"Why Choose Our Febflower Candy Thermometer: 1.Speed (2-3 sec). 2.Accuracy (±0.8°F). 3.Super Easy To Use. NOTICE: 1.Do not leave the instant read meat thermometer in the oven while cooking. 2.Do not completely immerse the digital thermometer in water for minutes. 3.Do not touch hot probe with bare hands. Easy to Calibrate: 1.Make a cup of ice-water ,then insert the probe so that it's touching the ice.When the temperature reading reaches a stable temperature, hold down the “CAL” key for 4 seconds. 2.After 4 seconds, the display will flash “CALL” on the screen, and will flash the temperature reading. Use the C/F key to increase the temperature reading or the “HOLD” key to decrease it until you reach 0°C or 32°F. 3.Note: Make sure that the ice water has time to reach its coldest . Otherwise, you may get an \"ERR\" message if the temperature is not at freezing. Product Specifications: -℉/℃ switchable -Large Bright LCD Backlight display, easy to read -Measurement range:58℉ to 572℉(-50-300℃) -Accuracy:（±1℉) between(-58℉~392℉),±2℉ more than 392℉ -Hold temperature function, it will \"hold\" the temperature reading until pressed again -Waterproof: It can survive an accidentally fall into water Package Included: 1 x Digital Food Thermometer (Battery Include) 1 x User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gkka0mqML._AC_SL1218_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROOSSI","source_asin":"B0BHQRR9HD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-236995","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHQRR9HD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHQRR9HD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
